# The Edge Impulse Arduino-library export (README step 1): ~23 MB and 1300+
# files of generated SDK, and it is YOUR project's model — everyone unzips
# their own into lib/, named after their own EI project. Only the two
# hand-written files (platformio.ini, src/main.cpp) live in the repo; the
# folder name in the #include has to match whatever your export is called.
lib/*_inferencing/
lib/.DS_Store
